     1798         ub.rvs-line-pump.state-am-qnty
     1799         ub.rvs-line-pump.meas-am-qnty
     1800         ub.rvs-line-pump.state-cf-qnty
     1801         ub.rvs-line-pump.meas-cf-qnty
